i rend="italic">vornehmer</hi>), sy he wyrsa <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Cn1020">Cn 1020</ref>,10 | <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Plural"><abbr>pl</abbr></ref> <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:accusativus"><abbr>ac</abbr></ref>:</hi> taliað þe wyrsan þa (<hi rend="italic">eos</hi>) <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 21 [<hi rend="italic">diesen Sinn belegt <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:unterAnderen"><abbr>u. a.</abbr></ref></hi> Saturn 359: se wyrsa ne wat in woruldrice on his mægwinum maran are]</dictScrap>
